sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Your contract
    participant TM as TaskManager
    participant Pipe as Compute pipeline
    participant CR as CommitmentRegistry

    C->>TM: FHE.add(lhs, rhs) calls createTask
    TM->>TM: validate inputs, check ACL
    TM-->>C: result handle (synchronous)
    TM--)Pipe: TaskCreated event
    Pipe->>Pipe: validate and order the task
    Pipe->>Pipe: execute the op, store ciphertext under the handle
    Pipe->>CR: postCommitments (batched)
